<title>UK: GOLF-LEONARD WINS BRITISH OPEN.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEONARD WINS BRITISH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>TROON, Scotland 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Justin Leonard won the British Open golf championship on Sunday.  </p>
<p>Leonard shot a closing round of 65 for a four-round total of 272 to finish three shots ahead of joint runners-up Jesper Parnevik of Sweden, who carded a final round of 73, and Briton Darren Clark, who shot 71.</p>
</text>
